# Shift Management

Static Persian night/morning scheduler for حامد مقدسی (`hamed`) and مهدی ارجمندزاده (`mehdi`). Admin is محمود شعبانی.

Path: `D:\Mahmoud\shift-management`
Repo: `https://github.com/shabanimahmoud92-design/shift`
Live (permanent): **https://shabanimahmoud92-design.github.io/shift/**

## Files

- `index.html`, `styles.css`, `app.js`, `auth.js`, `holidays.js`, `jalaali.js`
- Company Thursday holidays + OFF quotas live in `localStorage` (not shared across browsers)
- `publish.bat` = `git add` + commit + push to `origin/main` (GitHub Pages auto-updates in 1–2 min)

## Deploy

- GitHub Pages from `main` `/` (legacy). Do not use tiiny/Netlify Drop — they expire.
- After CSS/JS changes, tell the user to hard-refresh (`Ctrl+Shift+R`).
- Layout is full-width (no 1180px cap).
- Talk to the user in Persian, short and fast.
